  "about_item": [
    "✔ SAFE & EFFECTIVE TICK REMOVAL - Safely remove ticks from dogs, cats, and humans using a precision-designed tick remover tool and stainless steel tweezers. Helps lift the entire tick—head and body—without squeezing for cleaner removal.",
    "✔ IMPROVED GRIP – NO SQUEEZING DESIGN - Enhanced grip allows better control to grasp ticks close to the skin without crushing. Reduces slipping and helps minimize the risk of leaving parts behind during removal.",
    "✔ COMPLETE TICK REMOVAL KIT Includes a durable tick remover tool and fine tip stainless steel tweezers for handling both large and small ticks. Comes with a storage pouch and tick identification card for added convenience.",
    "✔ WORKS ON SMALL & LARGE TICKS - Designed to handle tiny ticks and larger ticks with precision. The combination of remover tool and tweezers gives flexibility for different tick sizes and situations.",
    "✔ FOR PETS & PEOPLE – MULTI-USE - Ideal for dogs, cats, and humans. Perfect for pet owners, families, hikers, campers, and outdoor use at home or on the go.",
    "✔ PORTABLE & READY ANYTIME - Compact and lightweight with included pouch for easy storage. Keep in your bag, car, or first aid kit for outdoor trips, travel, and everyday preparedness.",
    "✔ STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE & TICK IDENTIFICATION - Includes a clear tick identification card with helpful guidance to assist in recognizing common tick types and proper removal steps. Designed to give added confidence and support during use at home or outdoors.",
    "✔ EASY TO CARRY, EASY TO USE - Lightweight and compact enough for your bag, backpack, glove box, first aid kit, or pet gear. A practical tool kit for outdoor adventures, walks, vacations, and daily preparedness."
  ],
